menu "Bolis"

    config BOL_COUNTRY_CODE
        string "Country code of the radio"
        default "01"
        help
            The country code that the component sets before it starts WiFi.
            The code limits the channels that a run can sweep, so the run
            record states it. The default "01" is the world safe mode of
            ESP-IDF, which allows channels 1 to 11. Set a code that
            esp_wifi_set_country_code accepts.

    config BOL_PREBUILT
        bool "Mark the image as a prebuilt image"
        default n
        help
            CI sets this option when it builds a release image. The hello reply
            states the firmware path, so a reader of a run record knows whether
            the node ran a release image or a source build. Leave the option off
            for a source build.

endmenu
